    "summary": "Errata rewriting 2 imperatives of [Doctrina Imperatives](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.doctrina-imperatives). A unit under the Protector Imperative gets:\n\n- **[[HEAVY]](vsdata:weapon-ability/heavy)** on its ranged weapons\n- +1 Ballistic Skill for those ranged weapons\n- -1 to the **Hit roll** of melee attacks against it while it is **BATTLELINE** or no more than 6\" from a friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit\n\nA unit under the Conqueror Imperative gets:\n\n- **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** on its ranged weapons\n- +1 Weapon Skill for its melee weapons\n- +1 Armour Penetration on its models' attacks while it is **BATTLELINE** or no more than 6\" from a friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit",
